{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e07-scene-05",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "认出现场制片  (Recognising the Finale Night Producer)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bianbian": "边边",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "crew": "场务"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Stepping out of Stella's office, sharp-eyed reporter Bianbian thanks Bu Xiaogu for the coffee and suddenly recognises her from the night Li Mingji collapsed at Studio One. Listen to their Mandarin exchange first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "刚才谢谢你的咖啡啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "不客气。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "我看你挺眼熟啊，我记得你。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "李铭基出事那天晚上，你是现场制片吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "媒体席位置一直很满，只能给您安排在那儿了，还请您多包涵。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "我看你当时躲我，看来是讨厌我。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您误会了，我本来就是干行政的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "一线制片改行当行政，这里边肯定有事，不会跟李铭基有关吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "后来我查过这事，每一环我都查明白了，现在终于有点头绪。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "那个传说中出了问题、但后来查无此人的星天员工就是你吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "你变成行政是受罚，还是对你的一种保护？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "我是来写星天深度报道的，你是让我采访一下，还是让我随便写呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "下班有空吗？我请你喝一杯。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "行。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "刚才谢谢你的咖啡啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you for the coffee just now.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "不客气。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You are welcome.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "我看你挺眼熟啊，我记得你。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You look very familiar to me; I remember you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "李铭基出事那天晚上，你是现场制片吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'On the night Li Mingji had his emergency, you were a floor producer, right?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "媒体席位置一直很满，只能给您安排在那儿了，还请您多包涵。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Seats in the press row stayed full, so we could only put you there; please bear with us.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "我看你当时躲我，看来是讨厌我。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Back then you avoided me at every turn, so clearly you disliked me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您误会了，我本来就是干行政的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You misunderstood; I have been in administrative work all along.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "一线制片改行当行政，这里边肯定有事，不会跟李铭基有关吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'A frontline producer switching to admin surely hides a story — is it tied to Li Mingji?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "后来我查过这事，每一环我都查明白了，现在终于有点头绪。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I looked into every link of that case afterward, and now the missing piece makes sense.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "那个传说中出了问题、但后来查无此人的星天员工就是你吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That rumoured Xingtian staffer who vanished from the records afterward is you, right?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "你变成行政是受罚，还是对你的一种保护？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Was moving you to admin a punishment, or a way of protecting you?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "我是来写星天深度报道的，你是让我采访一下，还是让我随便写呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am here writing an in-depth piece on Xingtian — will you let me interview you, or write freely?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "下班有空吗？我请你喝一杯。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are you free after work? Let me buy you a drink.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "行。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Alright.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "刚才谢谢你的咖啡啊。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "不客气。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "我看你挺眼熟啊，我记得你。",
      "gap": 0.5
